WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.378
Two kinds of staff now share the admin console. Admins can do everything; Moderators

00:00:07.378 --> 00:00:08.895
look after members.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.385
A Moderator's navigation lists only the Dashboard and Members. Events and Services

00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:16.539
never appear.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.067
Open Events or Services by its address, and Admins only takes its place. The heading

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:28.987
takes focus, and the address bar keeps where you were going.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.533
Go to dashboard takes a Moderator straight back to their work.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.228
Change someone's role while they work, and their next move follows the new role,

00:00:42.228 --> 00:00:43.585
with no new sign-in.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.762
On the server, every admin endpoint takes the rule of its area from where it is

00:00:52.762 --> 00:00:56.919
routed, and the role is read from the database on every request.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.367
One table decides it, the same in both stacks. A new area stays closed to Moderators

00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:04.817
until it is named.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.412
Next, an audit of every staff change.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.814
That's slice twenty-nine point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for

00:01:22.814 --> 00:01:24.679
health in body and spirit.
